ps/3220380/extras/2c575f1d39cbf6f8d071884ba4ab011d.webm?t=1758286518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/2c575f1d39cbf6f8d071884ba4ab011d.mp4?t=1758286518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>\u26a1 MASTER THE ELEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the very forces of nature. Your survivors command ten distinct elements, including Fire, Water, Lightning, and Psychic. Discover devastating elemental reactions to gain the upper hand in combat. Will you <strong>vaporize</strong> Water with Fire, <strong>electro-charge</strong> it with Lightning, or <strong>freeze</strong> it with Ice? Outsmart your foes with tactical synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/4ef3544132471d3fb2bcd75aa120e187.poster.avif?t=1758286518\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/4ef3544132471d3fb2bcd75aa120e187.webm?t=1758286518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/4ef3544132471d3fb2bcd75aa120e187.mp4?t=1758286518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f ADAPT TO A DYNAMIC APOCALYPSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic <strong>Weather System</strong> featuring rain, thunderstorms, heatwaves, and sandstorms will directly impact combat, altering elemental effectiveness and forcing you to adapt your strategies on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/0f3c5cfee033644b15d85036e8d6b017.poster.avif?t=1758286518\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/0f3c5cfee033644b15d85036e8d6b017.webm?t=1758286518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/0f3c5cfee033644b15d85036e8d6b017.mp4?t=1758286518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f A SHIFTING BATTLEFIELD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mutated horrors are not mindless. Enemy factions led by powerful elite and boss mutants actively command their own territories on the map. As you make your move, they make theirs, spreading their influence and fortifying their positions. Prepare for sudden invasions on\u00a0secured territory! Will you rally your party to defend your foothold? Or will you make the tactical retreat, forfeiting the location to survive and fight another day?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/dc5fa76011e69cf6b4eed10c27176bde.poster.avif?t=1758286518\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/dc5fa76011e69cf6b4eed10c27176bde.webm?t=1758286518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/dc5fa76011e69cf6b4eed10c27176bde.mp4?t=1758286518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26fa\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>STRATEGIC CAMPING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Safety at camp is temporary and must be used wisely. Use <strong>Food</strong>\u00a0items to replenish your party's energy, but ration carefully\u2014exhaust your supplies and you risk <strong>Starvation</strong>. With a limited number of actions, every choice counts. Do you use <strong>Medical</strong> supplies to reduce <strong>Stress</strong> and treat <strong>Injuries</strong>, or spend time with <strong>Books</strong> to permanently improve your combat abilities?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/0242bfe5e48eaa57db9da99b28f22f73.poster.avif?t=1758286518\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/0242bfe5e48eaa57db9da99b28f22f73.webm?t=1758286518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/0242bfe5e48eaa57db9da99b28f22f73.mp4?t=1758286518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2620\ufe0f A TRUE ROGUELIKE CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the unforgiving world of <strong>Napocalypse</strong>, death is final. Every choice matters, and every run is uniquely generated with new locations, encounters, and loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/ebcb7fefb2f7448aa6b9dd664a373fac.poster.avif?t=1758286518\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/ebcb7fefb2f7448aa6b9dd664a373fac.webm?t=1758286518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220380/extras/ebcb7fefb2f7448aa6b9dd664a373fac.mp4?t=1758286518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you lead the survivors to a new dawn, or will Napoli be lost to the rubble forever?</strong> </p>","developers":["Instynct 